ght vertical portrait, cropped from about mid-thigh to slightly above the head, with the body filling most of the frame. The camera angle is roughly at her torso level or slightly below eye level, and the perspective makes the body appear prominent in the foreground. The background is very simple: a plain, pale textured wall, likely outdoors. There are no other objects or distractions. The lighting looks bright and natural, likely daylight, coming from above and slightly to one side. It creates soft shadows and warm highlights on the skin, especially across the back, hips, and face. The image has a crisp, high-contrast, somewhat stylized look, with strong detail and a slightly edited or polished finish. The background is evenly lit, making the subject stand out clearly."
